      "releaseNotes": "To bring you a better viewing experience, BlinkDrama has made the following updates:\n\nSmoother Playback: Optimized our video engine for faster loading and smoother playback with fewer interruptions.\nImproved Stability: Fixed known issues and optimized system performance for a faster, more stable experience.\nMore Hit Dramas: New short dramas are added regularly, bringing you more exciting stories to enjoy anytime, anywhere!",
